nal seafood online at  plant-based seafoodco.com pair your  protein of choice with vegetables in  your fridge like broccoli bell peppers  and mushrooms with a stir-fry sauce and  cooked whole grain like brown rice or  quinoa to build a complete meal  for a fun and nutritious snack that  helps you meet your recommended one and  a half to two and a half cup servings of  fruit for the day try stuffed bananas  banana loca is a new innovative kitchen  gadget as seen on shark tank that  straightens a banana pours it while it's  still in its peel and allows you to fill  it with a variety of tasty and  nutritious food pairings start by  cutting off the tip of the banana use  the holder to straighten the banana and  use the core to remove the center add  filling to the hopper and press the  lever down to fill the banana for a  satisfying snack that pairs protein with  fiber filled with yogurt or nut butter  or for a nutritious dessert filled with  honey jams jellies or even nutella it's  an easy and fun way for kids and adults  to enjoy bananas a good source of fiber  and potassium you can find banana loca  bananaloca.com and on amazon  i hope you enjoyed this simple healthy  meal and snack ideas for more recipes  and nutrition tips you can visit my  website nutritionbymia.com  and instagram nutrition by
 

